<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:02:51 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>理查德·布兰森 (Richard Branson) 双重预订了自己的工作面试。与他一起堵车2.5小时的候选人现在是维珍航空的首席执行官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/virgin-group-ceo-josh-bayliss-double-booked-first-job-interview-by-billionaire-richard-branson-career-lessons-success/</link><description>乔什·贝利斯 (Josh Bayliss) 于 2005 年以律师身份加入维珍，并从理查德·布兰森 (Richard Branson) 非常规的经营方式中汲取经验，升任首席执行官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/JoshBayliss.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/virgin-group-ceo-josh-bayliss-double-booked-first-job-interview-by-billionaire-richard-branson-career-lessons-success/</guid></item><item><title>IPO缩减后，Shein首席执行官的财富缩水150亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/shein-ceo-wealth-sky-xu-15-billion-hong-kong-ipo/</link><description>Shein 将于周二在香港上市，其 2022 年市值仅为 1000 亿美元，略高于四分之一。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2244511289-e1788132887403.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 23:39:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/shein-ceo-wealth-sky-xu-15-billion-hong-kong-ipo/</guid></item><item><title>三年前，华纳兄弟为了减免税收而砍掉了《郊狼大战阿克米》(Coyote vs. Acme)。但在公众强烈抗议和票房大卖之后，它终于在影院上映了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/warner-bros-coyote-vs-acme-tax-write-off-theaters-box-office-debut/</link><description>这部乐一通故事片由 Ketchup Entertainment 赋予了新的生命，首映周末票房收入估计为 1,550 万美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26233516913365.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 23:26:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/warner-bros-coyote-vs-acme-tax-write-off-theaters-box-office-debut/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗总统承认“我们有很多问题”，导弹“毫无用处”，因为美国扼杀了伊朗经济，同时削弱了德黑兰对霍尔木兹海峡的控制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/iran-economy-many-problems-inflation-naval-blockade-hormuz-oil-exports-fuel-imports/</link><description>“现在人们都处于边缘；如果我给他们施加更大的压力，他们可能会从边缘掉下来。我们必须小心，不要有人掉下来。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9883353-e1788125503144.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 23:10:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/iran-economy-many-problems-inflation-naval-blockade-hormuz-oil-exports-fuel-imports/</guid></item><item><title>霍尔木兹之战：美军一个月来首次对伊朗采取军事行动，袭击了用来部署水雷的火箭发射器</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/battle-for-hormuz-us-forces-iran-rocket-launchers-sea-mines/</link><description>美国军方上周完成了海峡国际航线上的水雷清除工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9881017.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 21:04:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/battle-for-hormuz-us-forces-iran-rocket-launchers-sea-mines/</guid></item><item><title>这不仅仅是数学和阅读。教育专家表示，课堂设备剥夺了孩子们人工智能未来所需的技能以及如何成为“完整的人”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/classroom-devices-backlash-online-learning-test-scores-cognition-human-skills-ai-future/</link><description>“孩子们不需要上学就能变得更像数字世界。他们在课外的大部分时间已经沉浸在这个世界中。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1205027264-e1788116044495.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 20:01:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/classroom-devices-backlash-online-learning-test-scores-cognition-human-skills-ai-future/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普敦促 FCC 调查媒体民意调查，惩罚 NBC 主持人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/trump-fcc-probe-media-polling-nbc-meet-the-press-kristen-welker/</link><description>总统还猛烈抨击了美国全国广播公司（NBC）“会见媒体”节目主持人克里斯汀·韦尔克（Kristen Welker），称他在今年的初选中对共和党候选人的支持显示出好坏参半的结果。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2188309824-e1788115081387.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:42:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/trump-fcc-probe-media-polling-nbc-meet-the-press-kristen-welker/</guid></item><item><title>世界基本上对贝森特的“诺曼底登陆日”伊朗制裁威胁不屑一顾</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/scott-bessent-d-day-iran-sanctions-threat-china-uae-turkey/</link><description>伊朗银行在迪拜的分行仍然营业。伊朗和土耳其以及伊朗和阿拉伯联合酋长国之间的商业航班也继续进行。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291336298-e1788114556167.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:34:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/scott-bessent-d-day-iran-sanctions-threat-china-uae-turkey/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌地图将美国安大略湖标签更改为美洲湖</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/google-maps-lake-ontario-label-lake-america-trump-canada-tariffs/</link><description>该公司表示，这一决定是由于美国政府官方地理命名系统发生变化而做出的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291741150-e1788114179268.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:26:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/google-maps-lake-ontario-label-lake-america-trump-canada-tariffs/</guid></item><item><title>“我认为他们这样做是为了保住权力”——委内瑞拉人抨击政府将大量石油储备移交给美国的协议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/venezuela-oil-reserves-trump-us-access-delcy-rodriguez/</link><description>委内瑞拉代理总统德尔西·罗德里格斯称，该协议是迈向经济复苏的一步，将实现该国石油工业的现代化。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26213489890530-e1788113472279.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 18:19:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/venezuela-oil-reserves-trump-us-access-delcy-rodriguez/</guid></item></channel></rss>